WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.004
Although designed for federal environments, NIST SP 800-53 is frequently used outside government.

2
00:00:07.004 --> 00:00:13.440
Many organizations use the catalog as a reference for building mature security and privacy programs.

3
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:22.011
Organizations often map controls to internal policies, customer requirements, regulatory obligations, and other frameworks.

4
00:00:22.011 --> 00:00:27.469
This mapping helps teams translate broad security goals into specific control expectations.

5
00:00:27.469 --> 00:00:32.368
Commercial adoption happens because the catalog is comprehensive and well understood.

6
00:00:32.368 --> 00:00:38.624
It gives organizations a common way to discuss safeguards even when formal federal compliance is not required.

7
00:00:38.624 --> 00:00:42.236
Using the catalog outside government still requires judgment.

8
00:00:42.236 --> 00:00:48.522
Teams should adapt the controls to their mission, systems, resources, laws, and risk environment.
